      980   PROCEDURE adm-update-record :
      981       MESSAGE
      982         "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
      983           "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Update.":U
      984             VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
